<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">YOUR ORDERS</view><view class="title">每一次购物，都有记录。</view><view class="subtitle">当前匿名演示身份的购物订单</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{orders}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="detail" data-session="{{item.session_id}}"><view class="badge-title"><text>{{item.cabinet_id}} · {{item.shortId}}</text><text class="tag">{{item.label}}</text></view><view class="line"></view><view class="row"><text class="muted">{{item.date}}</text><text class="amount">¥{{item.amount}}</text></view><view class="muted">点击查看清单和模拟交易记录 →</view></view><view class="card empty" wx:if="{{!orders.length}}">还没有订单，先去首页选择一个柜体。</view><view class="footnote">匿名身份令牌有效12小时；后端重启后需重新登录。</view></view>
